                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Neon Aileron is a fun shoot 'em up sidescroller with an armed flying ship.\nThe game comes with 7 challenging levels and on each level a more challenging boss.\nThe bosses have parts which you have to destroy, you don't need to destroy all parts in order to destroy the part that destroys the boss, but if you destroy all parts then you get more points.\nGameplay is also a bit fast paced which is good for these kind of games.\nAnother good part of the game is that it supports local co-op or remote play together on steam.\nThe game also includes 5 different weapons and a super weapon. My personal favorite weapon was the thunderstrike.\nIt's not a bad game, what could make it better are more levels.\nhttps://youtu.be/qNGb-98PxZ0",
